"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_cced803d056647a9a913ba1a","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-18-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro-no-thinking\n> vitest run\n\n\n RUN  v1.6.1 /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-18-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro-no-thinking\n\n ❯ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (43 tests | 1 failed | 19 skipped) 15ms\n   ❯ src/claim-office.spec.ts > Claim Office > should reimburse 400 G for steel sword enchant 3 damaged 500 G\n     → expected { results: [ { premium: 115 } ] } to deeply equal { results: [ …(2) ] }\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯ Failed Tests 1 ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n\n FAIL  src/claim-office.spec.ts > Claim Office > should reimburse 400 G for steel sword enchant 3 damaged 500 G\nAssertionError: expected { results: [ { premium: 115 } ] } to deeply equal { results: [ …(2) ] }\n\n- Expected\n+ Received\n\n  Object {\n    \"results\": Array [\n      Object {\n        \"premium\": Any<Number>,\n      },\n-     Object {\n-       \"payout\": 400,\n-       \"remainingCap\": 1600,\n-     },\n    ],\n  }\n\n ❯ src/claim-office.spec.ts:289:20\n    287|     };\n    288|     const result = processScenario(scenario);\n    289|     expect(result).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: expect.any(Number) a…\n       |                    ^\n    290|   });\n    291| \n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/1]⎯\n\n Test Files  1 failed (1)\n      Tests  1 failed | 23 passed | 19 todo (43)\n   Start at  03:28:41\n   Duration  180ms (transform 35ms, setup 0ms, collect 34ms, tests 15ms, environment 0ms, prepare 43ms)\n\n ELIFECYCLE  Test failed. See above for more details.\n\n\nCommand exited with code 1"}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1784950121975},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Red Phase Complete:\n**Test Prediction**: Expected 2 results, got only 1 — claim step is not yet handled\n**Compilation Prediction**: No compilation error Correct\n**Runtime Prediction**: Claim step is skipped, only quote result appears Correct\n\n## Green -- Implement claim: standard reimbursement\n\nI need to:\n1. Store policy information when processing quotes (insurance values per policy)\n2. Handle claim steps: compute payout, track remaining cap\n3. Output { payout, remainingCap } for claims\n\nLet me implement the minimal claim handling.\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_191a4211700f4c75af0610bf","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-18-36_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro-no-thinking/src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":673,"output":207,"cacheRead":88320,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":89200,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784950121977,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-b1633d70-f692-4432-9f87-5b0a28bcaf76","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_191a4211700f4c75af0610bf","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// Quote and claim processing logic\ninterface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: Step[];\n}\n\ntype Step = QuoteStep | ClaimStep;\n\ninterface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\ninterface ClaimStep {\n  op: \"claim\";\n  policy: number;\n  incident: { cause: string; damages: Damage[] };\n}\n\ninterface Item {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface Damage {\n  itemType: string;\n  amount: number;\n}\n\nconst ITEM_PRICES: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n  rune: 25,\n  moonstone: 25,\n};\n\nconst CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.5;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.3;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\n\nconst BLOCK_PRICE_COMPONENTS = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\nconst BLOCK_PRICE = 60;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE_RATE = 0.1;\n\nconst LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.2;\nconst LOYALTY_YEARS_THRESHOLD = 2;\n\nconst FOLLOW_UP_DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.15;\n\nconst EXACT_BLOCK_COUNT = 3;\nconst PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\n\nconst calculateQuote = (items: Item[]): { baseSum: number; itemSurcharges: number } => {\n  const componentCounts: Record<string, number> = {};\n  let baseSum = 0;\n  let itemSurcharges = 0;\n\n  for (const item of items) {\n    if (BLOCK_PRICE_COMPONENTS.has(item.type)) {\n      componentCounts[item.type] = (componentCounts[item.type] || 0) + 1;\n    } else {\n      const basePrice = ITEM_PRICES[item.type] || 0;\n      baseSum += basePrice;\n      if (item.cursed) {\n        itemSurcharges += basePrice * CURSED_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n      }\n      if (item.enchantment >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD) {\n        itemSurcharges += basePrice * HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (const [type, count] of Object.entries(componentCounts)) {\n    const price = ITEM_PRICES[type] || 0;\n    if (count === EXACT_BLOCK_COUNT) {\n      baseSum += BLOCK_PRICE;\n    } else {\n      baseSum += count * price;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { baseSum, itemSurcharges };\n};\n\nexport const processScenario = (scenario: Scenario): unknown => {\n  const results: unknown[] = [];\n  let quoteCount = 0;\n  for (const step of scenario.steps) {\n    if (step.op === \"quote\") {\n      const { baseSum, itemSurcharges } = calculateQuote(step.items);\n      let quotePremium = baseSum + itemSurcharges;\n      quotePremium += baseSum * FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE_RATE;\n      if (scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO >= LOYALTY_YEARS_THRESHOLD) {\n        quotePremium -= baseSum * LOYALTY_DISCOUNT_RATE;\n      }\n      quoteCount++;\n      if (quoteCount > 1) {\n        quotePremium -= baseSum * FOLLOW_UP_DISCOUNT_RATE;\n      }\n      const premium = Math.ceil(quote